WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.282 --> 00:00:07.034
- I am a very good test taker.

00:00:07.034 --> 00:00:08.307
- I'm a terrible test taker.

00:00:08.307 --> 00:00:10.065
- I think I'm a pretty
fantastic test taker.

00:00:10.065 --> 00:00:11.956
- Why do they have a
separate literacy test?

00:00:11.956 --> 00:00:13.186
I don't understand.

00:00:13.186 --> 00:00:14.936
Is it a racist thing?

00:00:27.562 --> 00:00:28.395
Ah, go.

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:30.394
- This test is to be given to anyone

00:00:30.394 --> 00:00:33.414
who cannot prove a fifth grade education.

00:00:33.414 --> 00:00:35.813
- One wrong answer denotes
failure of the test.

00:00:35.813 --> 00:00:39.563
- You have ten minutes
to complete this test.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:46.680
- Why are there two firsts?

00:00:52.868 --> 00:00:53.796
- Yeah, that's where I'm like,

00:00:53.796 --> 00:00:54.629
- What?

00:00:54.629 --> 00:00:55.462
What?

00:00:55.462 --> 00:00:57.462
- Wow does my head hurt.

00:01:00.329 --> 00:01:01.667
- But that doesn't, what does,

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:03.242
that doesn't make sense to me.

00:01:03.242 --> 00:01:05.325
- This is a literacy quiz?

00:01:11.702 --> 00:01:14.070
- Ah, it's the Illuminati eye.

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:15.184
- Spell backwards forwards.

00:01:15.184 --> 00:01:16.069
(laughter)

00:01:16.069 --> 00:01:16.983
- I gotta move faster.

00:01:16.983 --> 00:01:17.937
- 30 questions?

00:01:17.937 --> 00:01:18.770
Oh god.

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:20.697
- I'm killin' this game.

00:01:20.697 --> 00:01:21.530
- Fuck.

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:23.138
- It's making me feel very
competitive right now.

00:01:23.138 --> 00:01:24.180
Like, we have to.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.801
- I'm, I'm dead.

00:01:25.801 --> 00:01:26.882
I'm just giving up.

00:01:26.882 --> 00:01:28.450
Okay, okay, okay.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:29.700
- This is hard.

00:01:31.898 --> 00:01:34.185
- We got to question 25.

00:01:34.185 --> 00:01:35.468
- I would not be able to vote.

00:01:35.468 --> 00:01:36.301
- I wouldn't either.

00:01:36.301 --> 00:01:39.895
- Failed hardcore, because I
didn't even complete the test.

00:01:39.895 --> 00:01:42.209
- I know that this test was intentionally

00:01:42.209 --> 00:01:45.516
trying to trick me and it succeeded.

00:01:45.516 --> 00:01:47.921
And that makes me really, really sad.

00:01:47.921 --> 00:01:50.728
- The efforts to go to to make
discrimination officially,

00:01:50.728 --> 00:01:51.835
it blows my mind.

00:01:51.835 --> 00:01:53.966
- To be a black person and
to have the right to vote,

00:01:53.966 --> 00:01:57.644
you had to literally get
through fucking riddles.

00:01:57.644 --> 00:02:00.582
- It made me realize that
I take voting for granted.

00:02:00.582 --> 00:02:02.166
- It makes me appreciate it more,

00:02:02.166 --> 00:02:03.764
to be able to actually
have the right to vote.

00:02:03.764 --> 00:02:06.077
Your duty, almost, as an American citizen

00:02:06.077 --> 00:02:06.910
to vote.

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:08.518
- This is eye opening to
me in a different light,

00:02:08.518 --> 00:02:10.375
because in Puerto Rico right now

00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:13.026
we're a country of United States citizens,

00:02:13.026 --> 00:02:15.206
and because we're a
territory we can't vote.

00:02:15.206 --> 00:02:16.657
- I just think that we've found new ways

00:02:16.657 --> 00:02:19.467
to suppress voting
rights in certain states

00:02:19.467 --> 00:02:21.208
where there's only three or four places

00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:22.656
where you can register to vote,

00:02:22.656 --> 00:02:25.362
and they're miles and
miles away from counties

00:02:25.362 --> 00:02:28.945
that have a predominantly
poor demographic.

00:02:34.127 --> 00:02:35.848
- What makes me more upset is just knowing

00:02:35.848 --> 00:02:38.638
that there's no like concrete answers.

00:02:38.638 --> 00:02:41.286
The person who is administering the test

00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:44.619
is the one who determines if it's right.

00:02:47.635 --> 00:02:49.894
Yeah, this just proves that black people

00:02:49.894 --> 00:02:51.793
should never say they
wanna go back in time.

00:02:51.793 --> 00:02:55.043
There's just nothing better back there.

